# Testing

No behavior change without coverage when a seam exists.

## Preferred stack

- **Vitest** — pure JS (geometry, color, deepMerge, hotkey, settings model)
- **JSON Schema + fixtures** — Electron ↔ AHK contract
- **AHK test runner** — load fixtures / parity vectors (Windows)
- **Playwright Electron** — launch, save, import/export smoke with isolated userData

## Fixtures

Keep representative `AHPSettings` fixtures for: minimal default, builtins, submenu, hotkey edge cases, custom functions, legacy/malformed imports, portable layout.

## Gates

- Pure helpers: unit tests
- Settings shape: schema validate + JS/AHK round-trip
- Fixes: regression test in the same PR
- Runtime input/DPI: deterministic tests first; hardware matrix for the rest
